---
name: Custom gh-aw image experiment
description: Exercise the demo image in the Codex agent container and reach Serena through the gh-aw gateway.
on:
  workflow_dispatch:
permissions:
  contents: read
  packages: read
engine:
  id: codex
  model-provider: github
  model: copilot/gpt-6.1-sol
timeout-minutes: 10
max-turns: 5
sandbox:
  agent:
    images:
      agent: __AGENT_IMAGE__
      squid: ghcr.io/github/gh-aw-firewall/squid:0.29.11@sha256:861739ecf924dd2db5e5fb652db2ad82aaafd1615623297ddabc8f41a36b2847
      api-proxy: ghcr.io/github/gh-aw-firewall/api-proxy:0.29.11@sha256:88d2d0e315a504d93fd4fb8847fd0f6b7f4469f41a6fc6047b3dc9654c56ab2c
tools:
  bash: ["*"]
  cli-proxy: false
mcp-servers:
  serena:
    type: stdio
    container: __PROJECT_IMAGE__
    entrypoint: /bin/sh
    entrypointArgs:
      - -ec
      - |
        mkdir -p /tmp/project/.serena
        cp /opt/review-demo/demo/pricing.* /tmp/project/
        cp /opt/review-demo/mcp/serena-project.yml /tmp/project/.serena/project.yml
        exec /opt/serena-venv/bin/serena start-mcp-server --project /tmp/project --context /opt/review-demo/mcp/serena-context.yml --mode one-shot --agent-interface tools --enable-web-dashboard false --open-web-dashboard false --enable-gui-log-window false
    args: [--network, none]
    allowed: [list_dir]
safe-outputs:
  create-issue: false
  report-failure-as-issue: false
  report-incomplete:
    create-issue: false
  report-failed-jobs: false
  report-missing-tool: false
  report-missing-data: false
  noop:
    report-as-issue: false
---

Run `/review-demo/check` in the agent shell. Call Serena's `list_dir` for the project root and report the observed results. The shell and Serena run in separate containers.
